  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given $f(x)=\\frac{4 x+3}{6 x-4}$<br />Let $y=\\frac{4 x+3}{6 x-4}$,<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />& \\Rightarrow 6 x y-4 y=4 x+3 \\Rightarrow x(6 y-4)=3+4 y \\\\<br />& \\Rightarrow x=\\frac{3+4 y}{6 y-4} \\\\<br />& f^{-1}(x)=\\frac{3+4 x}{6 x-4}<br />\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
